{
  "_comment": "Fixtures of computeSchedule and previewMove, run by schedule.test.ts and by rust/crates/flow-domain/src/schedule.rs: both languages must give these answers. 2026-11-02 is a Monday. `expected` lists only the fields a case is about; every listed field must match exactly.",
